Progress package

Tool description, schema, validation and display metadata are adapted from
Sailry ef5e82ea, plugins/builtin/progress/agent/mod.rs,
plugins/builtin/progress/desktop/messages.rs and desktop/activity/{board,cards,projects}.rs.
The desktop package preserves its workbench grouping and card layout through
the public activity catalog, shared Client lanes and ordinary Kit controls.

The core records authoritative tool history and reduces task progress.
Session activity, navigation and notifications remain core capabilities.
